// Stack is a handle to gpui_kit::base::plot::shape::Stack<crate::data::Datum>, a library object the library keeps (PROTOCOLS.md section 13): a temporary handle when a read, a call or an event hands it out (gk.retain keeps it), a kept one from its constructor.
Stack :: struct {
